expected_result: "Every remedy pm health names for history_drift_missing_stream, per item and in bulk, runs to a clean history_drift check"
actual_result: pm history-repair <id> and pm history-repair --all refuse the missing stream with 'No history entries exist; nothing to repair.' and exit 1
